[category: CLASSROOM EXPRESSIONS]
[00:06.71] Come in, please.
[00:14.58] Sit down.
[00:18.73] Stand up, please.
[00:22.88] Open your book, please.
[00:29.54] Close your book, please.
[00:33.41] Don't open your book.
[00:39.05] Do you understand?
[00:44.02] Yes, I understand.
[00:49.58] No, I don't understand.
[00:55.35] Listen and repeat.
[01:01.60] Now read, please.
[01:07.55] That's fine.
[01:11.71] It's time to begin.
[01:17.17] Let's begin now.
[01:21.61] This is Lesson One.